EE67: E1                  530 |     POP H   ;GET BACK POINTER TO START OF BUFFER
EE68: C3 E1 ED            531 |     JMP COM10   ; AND START ALL OVER AGAIN.
                          532 | ;
                          533 | ;   CONTROL R....DROP DOWN TO NEW LINE AND RETYPE
