EEF9: 4D                  673 |     MOV C,L ;(DE) TO (HL), AND THEN TO (BC). WHY
EEFA: 44                  674 |     MOV B,H ;THE GRAND TOUR??
EEFB: C3 D3 ED            675 |     JMP PRNSTR  ;WHY JUMP BACK TO PRNSTR INSTEAD
