                          728 | ;   ERROR HANDLING ROUTINES
                          729 | ;
                          730 | ;   NOTE:
                          731 | ;       Again we see that convoluted nature of this
                          732 | ;       program. Why don't the error calls from the
                          733 | ;       program just jump to the code just following
