------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

EF76: EB                  830 |     XCHG        ;
EF77: 22 DB F9            831 |     SHLD    SECTBL  ;
                          832 | ;   
                          833 | ;   (DE) NOW POINTS TO DIRBUF IN PARAMETER TABLE.
                          834 | ;   THE FOLLOWING ARE NOW MOVED INTO BDOS PARAMETER AREA:
                          835 | ;
                          836 | ;   (DIRBUF)    POINTER TO DIRECTORY BUFFER
                          837 | ;   (DPBLK)     POINTER TO DISK PARAMETER BLOCK
