                         1813 | ;
                         1814 | ;   SEARCH FOR OCCURENCE OF FILE NAME IN DIRECTORY
                         1815 | ;
                         1816 | ;   SERCHF IS INITIAL ENTRY POINT WHICH LEAVES
                         1817 | ;   FCB VECTOR FOR USE BY SUBSEQUENT SEARCHES
                         1818 | ;   WHICH ENTER BY WAY OF SERCHN. NO OTHER BDOS
                         1819 | ;   CALLS WHICH MAKE USE OF SRCHFP BETWEEN THE
                         1820 | ;   INTIAL CALL TO SERCHF AND CALLS TO SERCHN ARE
                         1821 | ;   ARE ALLOWED OR ELSE RATHER STRANGE THINGS MAY HAPPEN.
                         1822 | ;   REMEMBER THAT BDOS IS NOT DESIGNED FOR RECURSIVE CALLS
                         1823 | ;   AND STORED VALUES ARE OVERWRITTEN INSTEAD OF BEING
                         1824 | ;   PUSHED UP ONTO A LOCAL STACK.
                         1825 | ;
                         1826 | ;   SERCHF INITIATES (SRCHFL) TO 0FFH.
                         1827 | ;   A SUCCESSFUL MATCH CLEARS IT TO 00
                         1828 | ;
