                         2055 | ;   12 BYTE SEARCH TO MATCH THE OLD FILENAME.TYP
                         2056 | ;   WITH ENTRIES IN THE DIRECTORY. WHEN A MATCH
                         2057 | ;   IS MADE THE NEW FILENAME.TYP IS INSERTED INTO
                         2058 | ;   THE DIRECTORY SECTOR AND THE SECTOR WRITTTEN
                         2059 | ;   BACK ONTO THE DISK.
                         2060 | ;
